      "marker": "13.",
      "text": "For example, both Moses and Jesus were saved as infants from a king’s attempts to slay them (seeExodus 2:1–10;Matthew 2:13–18). Both came to deliver their people. There are five books of Moses (Genesis–Deuteronomy), and Matthew recorded five great sermons that Jesus Christ gave (seeMatthew 5–7;10;13;18;24–25). Moses revealed the lesser law, and Jesus restored the higher law, fulfilling the law of Moses (seeMatthew 5:17–48)."
    },
